  "result": "A change is done when these pass, per AGENTS.md:\n\n1. **Build:** `dotnet build backend/InvoiceApp.sln`\n2. **Unit tests:** `dotnet test backend/InvoiceApp.sln`\n3. **End-to-end tests**, if the change is visible in the UI: `cd e2e && npm install && npx playwright install chromium && npm test`\n4. **Hook and log scripts**, if you touched them: `node --test \".claude/hooks/tests/*.test.mjs\" \".githooks/tests/*.test.mjs\" \"scripts/ai-log/tests/*.test.mjs\"`\n\nBeyond the commands, the Definition of done requires that tests pass at every commit, that new behaviour has tests, that the spec's task list is current, and that each commit message says what changed and why.\n\nThe `verify-change` skill that AGENTS.md names is not in this checkout, so I could not check whether it lists other steps.",
